#=GF CC   This domain is found at the C-terminal end of NS3 helicase (Non-
#=GF CC   structural protein 3-helicase, NS3-Hel) found in Flavivirus such
#=GF CC   as Zika virus (ZIKV) and Dengue virus type 1 (DENV-1). This
#=GF CC   protein binds RNA and unwinds dsRNA in the 3' to 5' direction.
#=GF CC   It consists of three domains. This entry represent the final
#=GF CC   domain, which is mostly alpha-helical [1,2]. A highly conserved
#=GF CC   R residue located in this domain was proven essential for the
#=GF CC   enzymatic activities of the protein [3].
